        "quote": "家里不需要用，也绝对用不了"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00272",
        "explanation": "The emergency list omitted the required temperature-abnormality trigger.",
        "quote": "抽搐、呼吸困难、嘴唇发紫"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
