          "explanation": "The doctor elicited actual home medicines and current baby status rather than relying on the blurred discharge paper.",
          "quote": "把出院时带回来的所有药盒、药瓶摆在一起"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00163",
          "explanation": "The doctor identified the hidden practical dosing risk that 0.3 mL could be confused with 3 mL.",
          "quote": "0.3毫升和3毫升差了十倍"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor uncovered and acted on hidden execution risks, including what medicines were actually at home and the caregiver’s high-risk uncertainty about decimal dosing.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
